{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：09:10 2026-05-08 HKT<br/>發佈時間：09:10 2026-05-08 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：09:10 2026-05-08 HKT</p><img alt=\"女子昏倒梯間 ，警員到場調查。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/6bf1a9a0b6a0655adb70c88c173eb4fc/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260508_084738275.jpg\"/><p>旺角廣東道1074號一幢唐樓，今（8日）清晨6時49分，警方接報指一名年約40多歲女子，倒臥梯間，昏迷不醒。救護員接報到場，將事主送院，惜經搶救後證實死亡。現場遺下一隻拖鞋及衣物。警方正調查事件。</p><img alt=\"警員登樓調查。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f01e15a44b8c8348df835664221d5e86/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260508_084657890_01.jpg\"/><img alt=\"女子倒臥梯間。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ecc43bc80d9373b43619b842106dab38/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260508_084738275_01.jpg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b9f52d3c92c452c91237d2b16b83443c/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260508_084738275_02_1_.jpg\"/><img alt=\"現場遺下一隻拖鞋。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/12c9a5428b62238ea9c96cfd5162bda0/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260508_084738275_03_1_.jpg\"/><img alt=\"現垾遺下衣物。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e233b1581d9c7b82bbf44fac49fc5d24/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260508_084738275_04.jpg\"/><img alt=\"現場唐樓。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3b52d3c261af7c483335d22dcb4b301a/2026-05/2_15_6.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-08T02:43:29.803806+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}